# Open real scene art, scroll, preview, modem playback, share menu
size 120 40
spawn crates/acidtrip-io/tests/corpus/LDA-ANSIACADEMY.ANS
wait "LDA-ANSIACADEMY.ANS" 10s
keys esc
wait idle
shot art
mouse scroll down 20 20
mouse scroll down 20 20
mouse scroll down 20 20
shot art_scrolled
keys alt-e
wait "Share"
shot share
keys esc
keys ctrl-k
type modem
keys enter
wait 1500ms
shot playback
keys esc
